1
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:58,000
This Town Will Eat You Alive.

2
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Remains is a horror, science fiction film directed by Colin Theys.

3
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:42,000
The story centers on two lone survivors of a bizarre accident that
reduced most of the world's population to zombies.

4
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:34,000
They take refuge in a vacant casino and fight a
losing battle against the undead.

5
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:26,000
Tom, played by Grant Bowler.

6
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:18,000
Jensen, played by Miko Hughes.

7
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:10,000
Ramsey, played by Lance Reddick.

8
00:46:56,000 --> 00:47:02,000
Cindy, played by Tawny Cypress.

9
00:52:48,000 --> 00:52:54,000
Tori, played by Evalena Marie.

10
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
Victor, played by Anthony Marks.

11
01:04:32,000 --> 01:04:38,000
Remains, also billed as Steve Niles' Remains, is a
2011 post-apocalyptic horror film.

12
01:10:24,000 --> 01:10:30,000
It depicts a small group of people in a Reno, Nevada casino who have survived a nuclear
disaster while the rest of humanity has been turned into flesh eating zombies.

13
01:16:16,000 --> 01:16:22,000
It was produced by the Chiller Network and is based on
the comic book series of the same name.

14
01:22:08,000 --> 01:22:14,000
The tone is dark and thought_provoking.
